# Accepted NonsolvableDepsInStable findings on the stable amd64 profiles,
# read by amd64-solvable.py. One "<category>/<package> <atom>" per line,
# <atom> being the unsolvable dependency pkgcheck lists under "solutions".
# Every entry needs a dated reason above it.

# Upstream Kokoros has never tagged a release, so sci-ml/kokoros exists
# only as an unkeyworded live ebuild. system-kokoro is off by default, and
# enabling it means accepting that live package. accepted 2026-10-03
sci-ml/lemonade sci-ml/kokoros
